    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Cross-shard query fan-out and merge interface.</para>
<para>All methods are const and thread-safe; routing is stateless with respect to ongoing transactions.</para>
<para>Performance contract: routing overhead per query (excluding shard execution): ≤ 2 ms. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
